Package: chip-configs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, alsa-utils
Provides: chip-mconfigs
Replaces: chip-mconfigs
Conflicts: chip-mconfigs
Description: Base hardware configuration for the NextThing C.H.I.P.
 Flavor-independent, non-GUI hardware configuration: ALSA dmix software mixing,
 the resistive touchscreen (sun4i-ts) calibration + stable symlink, the PocketCHIP
 keyboard layout, backlight udev, and the power-button policy (a tap does not
 power off; the AXP209 hardware long-press still does). The X bits are no-ops
 without an X server, so this is safe on headless too.
